{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Overkill)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Overkill)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution-Cooler_Method\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution-Cooler Method</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6952ca10270fa7b1a9e31ec4aa61fa0bd26faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\otimes b = \\dfrac{a + b}{a - b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"106\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21c0ed78c6b2881adfceab6fe74f12213f1db3ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6\\otimes 4)\\otimes 3 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd13aed4c42ce72780ac4e8c0c22285e60c670c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/f/ecfd8a5c5f8d689e88f70dc278679b9b2dca1501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\otimes4=\\frac{6+4}{6-4}=\\frac{10}{2}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"191\" height=\"40\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c0237e5007f53657ea1abfb27c55acf0b8a499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\otimes3=\\frac{5+3}{5-3}=\\frac{8}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"228\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Overkill.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Overkill)\">Solution 2 (Overkill)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Overkill)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When you expand the general form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c054f0fa9c6bea6d3fd5bb3c559f97adbe724a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a\\otimes b)\\otimes c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c5b44dacef376f74c8e3db4f212d3411c79905.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a\\otimes b)\\otimes c = \\dfrac{a\\otimes b + c}{a\\otimes b - c}\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffb5bc846f22c8345fad734ace42feb5da4cd680.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a\\otimes b)\\otimes c = \\dfrac{\\dfrac{a + b}{a - b} + c}{\\dfrac{a + b}{a - b} - c}\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"81\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/ebaa482e2514980dad0d82621161149a593aa515.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a\\otimes b)\\otimes c = \\dfrac{\\dfrac{a + b + ac - bc}{a - b}}{\\dfrac{a + b - ac + bc}{a - b}}\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"81\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aeb7b12f0d4a9b39f3c64d83b315703d00746ab0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a\\otimes b)\\otimes c = \\dfrac{a + b + ac -bc}{a + b - ac + bc}\\]\" width=\"226\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Now, substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5507ab5a3d1f06941dabd1c26505d646367983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8271d4342b38d2ab38bb626ffad8b9dae00b5e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85a8469752049315230646d1833a993d68921547.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(6\\otimes 4)\\otimes 3 = \\dfrac{6 + 4 + 18 - 12}{6 + 4 - 18 + 12}\\]\" width=\"232\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c725614dc79b5d8a1d752d7738c930b1bac4a32.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(6\\otimes 4)\\otimes 3 = \\dfrac{16}{4}\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f54e528d3ba0f43368e148e9a11627ca39cdde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(6\\otimes 4)\\otimes 3 = 4\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/0046c887033d819b854e7621f6ace361ee9b5c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text {(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~megaboy6679\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution-Cooler_Method\">Video Solution-Cooler Method</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution-Cooler Method\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZfwtAiH_6PI&amp;t=36s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZfwtAiH_6PI&amp;t=36s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;b